It ships one pre-built JavaScript bundle that contains third-party code:

  inst/htmlwidgets/lib/reactflow/reactflow-bundle.min.js

That bundle is compiled from the sources in the srcjs/ directory of the
package's GitHub repository (https://github.com/tgerke/dplyneage) and
embeds the libraries listed below. Each is MIT licensed, and each retains
the copyright of its own authors. The license headers that the build
extracts from these libraries are kept alongside the bundle in
reactflow-bundle.min.js.LICENSE.txt.

